---
description: Stoa project conventions (always on)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `design-system/MASTER.md` for full context. Key rules:

- Stack: Next.js App Router + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + Supabase. No Base44 code.
- The only place that talks to Supabase is `src/lib/db/*`. Components and hooks import from there.
- Server-only secrets (`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, market-data keys, `CRON_SECRET`) never reach
  the client and are never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
- One accent color: `--accent` (signal blue). Green/red are reserved for market sentiment only
  (direction, gain/loss, grade tags). Never on generic UI.
- Fonts: Space Grotesk for display + numbers, Manrope for body/UI.
- Depth = hairline borders + surface tints. No drop shadows. Card radius 12px, buttons 8px.
- Zero em-dashes in user-visible text.
- `npm run lint` and `npm run typecheck` must pass before committing. No narration comments.
